WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.666
Start with the average-age condition This is the
same scalar pattern

00:00:05.693 --> 00:00:11.459
from earlier Run it and note which patients are
above the overall average

00:00:13.319 --> 00:00:18.943
These rows become candidates for the final combined
query Testing the

00:00:18.970 --> 00:00:22.127
condition separately makes later debugging much
easier
